94
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:57,660
I don't want them to suspect this is my first trial.

95
00:08:57,660 --> 00:09:03,740
This lawyer had fallen victim to the don'ts syndrome, a form of negative goal

96
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:09,480
setting. The don'ts can be self -fulfilling because your mind responds to pictures.

97
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:15,200
Research conducted at Stanford University shows a mental image fires the nervous

98
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:18,540
system the same way as actually doing something.

99
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:25,480
That means when a golfer tells himself, don't hit the ball into the water, his mind

